  "title": "Damora Therapeutics Announces Inducement Grants Under Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(c)(4)",
  "summary": "BOSTON, June 01, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Damora Therapeutics, Inc. (NASDAQ: DMRA) (“Damora”), a biotechnology company working to fundamentally redefine care for patients with blood disorders, today announced that it granted equity awards to six newly-hired, non-executive employees on June 1, 2026.",
